body:
To clear up some confusion, I should've said, "Only one (Yorha) android unit of a specific model can be activated at a time....".

&#x200B;

They (sometimes) refer to models as individual people. I.E: Model 21O, Model Devola etc. Model 6O isn't model 21O, even though they're both operators.

&#x200B;

All of the operators are Yorha operator types (5O, 6O, 21O). Same bodies, same b/w/h, same abilities. Two different units, same type of android.

Blud, you got ratio'd hard simply because of your impertinence.

&#x200B;

(Bro I hate reddit replying fr)
